#: routes/splash.py:26
msgid "Never sing again... ever."
msgstr "Jangan nyanyi lagi... selamanya."

#: routes/splash.py:27
msgid "That was a really good impression of a dying cat!"
msgstr "Itu sangat mirip suara kucing sekarat!"

#: routes/splash.py:28
msgid "Thank God it's over."
msgstr "Syukurlah sudah selesai."

#: routes/splash.py:29
msgid "Pass the mic, please!"
msgstr "Tolong serahkan mikrofonnya!"

#: routes/splash.py:30
msgid "Well, I'm sure you're very good at your day job."
msgstr "Yah, pasti kamu jago di pekerjaan sehari-hari."

#: routes/splash.py:33
msgid "I've seen better."
msgstr "Sudah pernah dengar yang lebih bagus."

#: routes/splash.py:34
msgid "Ok... just ok."
msgstr "Oke... biasa saja."

#: routes/splash.py:35
msgid "Not bad for an amateur."
msgstr "Lumayan untuk pemula."

#: routes/splash.py:36
msgid "You put on a decent show."
msgstr "Penampilan yang cukup bagus."

#: routes/splash.py:37
msgid "That was... something."
msgstr "Itu... lumayan unik."

#: routes/splash.py:40
msgid "Congratulations! That was unbelievable!"
msgstr "Selamat! Luar biasa sekali!"

#: routes/splash.py:41
msgid "Wow, have you tried auditioning for The Voice?"
msgstr "Wah, pernah ikut audisi The Voice belum?"

#: routes/splash.py:42
msgid "Please, sing another one!"
msgstr "Tolong nyanyi satu lagu lagi!"

#: routes/splash.py:43
msgid "You rock! You know that?!"
msgstr "Kamu keren banget! Sadar ngga sih?!"

#: routes/splash.py:44
msgid "Woah, who let Freddie Mercury in here?"
msgstr "Wah, siapa yang ngajak Freddie Mercury masuk ke sini?"

